# PostHog analytics — copy this file to .env.local and fill in your project key.
#
# 1. Create a free EU-region project at https://eu.posthog.com
# 2. Project settings -> paste the "Project API Key" (starts with phc_) below
# 3. Also add NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_KEY in the Vercel dashboard (Project ->
#    Settings -> Environment Variables) so production reports too.
#
# The host stays "/ingest": requests are reverse-proxied through this domain
# (see next.config.ts) to the EU PostHog cloud so ad-blockers don't drop them.

NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_KEY=
NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_HOST=/ingest
